@startuml SD_OrderBaru
skinparam sequence {
  ActorBackgroundColor LightGreen
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  ArrowColor DarkGreen
}

actor "Staff" as Staff
participant "Browser\n(Next.js)" as UI
participant "API Route\n/api/order" as API
participant "Auth\nMiddleware" as Auth
database "Database\n(MySQL)" as DB
collections "S3 Storage" as S3

Staff -> UI : Buka halaman Order Baru
UI -> API : GET /api/order\n(ambil daftar produk & customer)
API -> Auth : Verifikasi sesi pengguna
Auth --> API : Valid — userId, role
API -> DB : SELECT products, customers
DB --> API : Data produk & customer
API --> UI : Response JSON

Staff -> UI : Isi form:\ncustomer, produk, qty, harga,\ndiskon, ongkir, metode bayar, deadline
UI -> UI : Hitung grand total secara lokal

Staff -> UI : Klik Submit Order
UI -> API : POST /api/order\n{customerId, items[], grandTotal, ...}
activate API

API -> Auth : Verifikasi sesi pengguna
Auth --> API : Valid

API -> DB : BEGIN TRANSACTION
API -> DB : INSERT order\n(generate nomorOrder otomatis)
DB --> API : order.id

API -> DB : INSERT order_items[]\n(satu per satu untuk setiap item)
DB --> API : items tersimpan

alt Terdapat file desain yang diunggah
  UI -> S3 : Upload file desain
  S3 --> UI : URL file berhasil
  API -> DB : INSERT design_file\n{orderId, filePath, uploadedById}
  DB --> API : file tersimpan
end

API -> DB : COMMIT TRANSACTION
DB --> API : OK
deactivate API

API --> UI : 201 Created + data order
UI --> Staff : Redirect ke detail order\nToast "Order berhasil dibuat"

@enduml
